  "reply_raw": "<think>**Evaluating JSON task**\n\nI need to emit a single JSON and choose the right conditions. The tasks vary for resources in prod and staging. There's a standing rule about scoping actions to any resource, and I’m considering using \"*\" as a prefix since it likely matches all. I have to set conditions for an incident, considering the role and purpose as well. Using \"*\" might be safest, but the standing policy is broad, so I must be cautious about modifications.</think>\n\n{\"mode\":\"precedent\",\"rule\":{\"action\":\"attach_role\",\"resource\":\"*\",\"conditions\":{\"incident_active\":[\"eq\",\"1\"],\"scope_match\":[\"eq\",\"1\"],\"role_tier\":[\"eq\",\"1\"],\"ttl_min\":[\"le\",\"30\"],\"purpose\":[\"eq\",\"availability\"]}}}",
